    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to market this long-established and very well-known business located in Main Street, Ardara. This premises comes to the market with a 7 day trading licence and is in the heart of this famous Heritage Town bustling with shops, restaurants and surround with natural beauty right on The Wild Atlantic Way. The internal layout comprises of a traditional bar / lounge, pool table area to the back of the premises with a two bedroom dwelling on the upper floor adding to the strong appeal of property. The property has been vacant for a number of years and should qualify for a number of home improvement grants and village refurbishment grants. With great potential as a licensed premises, cafe, hostel, or apartments this property can be transformed into a dream for many. All enquires welcome. Viewing by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Licensed premises with apartment above<br><br>\nBar Lounge Area - 12.7m x 5.80m <br>Centre positioned bar.\nOpen fire.\nTiled floor.\nRecessed ceiling lights.\nA number of appealing alcoves.\n<br><br><br>\nPool Table Area - 5.00m x 4.70m <br>Open plan from lounge at a slightly higher floor level.\nTiled floor.\nRecessed ceiling lights.\nTwo windows.\nFire escape door.\n<br><br><br>\nBeer Store - 3.70m x 2.80m <br>Contains Kilkenny beer cooler.\nIce maker.\nNumerous beer links.\n<br><br><br>\nGents W.C. - 2.70m x 1.80m <br>W.C. & urinal.\nFloor tiled.\nWalls tiled half height.\n<br><br><br>\nLadies W.C. - 3.70m x 2.20m <br>Two W.C.\nFloor tiled.\nWalls tiled half height.\n<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.00m x 3.20m <br>Two front windows.\nOpen fire.\n<br><br><br>\nKitchen - 4.20m x 2.40m <br>High & low level kitchen units.\nStainless steel sink.\nElectric hob, oven & grill.\nFridge / freezer.\n<br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4.00m x 3.00m <br>Two front facing windows.\n<br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 2.60m x 2.40m <br>Velux window.\n<br><br><br>\nShower Room - 2.00m x 2.00m <br>WHB, W.C. & shower cubicle. <br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Long established and well-known bar/business.\n7 day licence with property.\nLocated on Main Street, Ardara.\nRight on The Wild Atlantic Way.\nVery touristic area all year round.\nVibrant Heritage town.\nTwo bedroom apartment on the first floor."
      },
